<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Core Discharge</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Core Discharge</ansi> is the Core Guardian's boss ability in the Crash Site.
Once the Guardian has drained enough strength from the room, its core
flares white-hot and the air begins to scream. It warns you for two
rounds, then a devastating blast hits everyone in the room.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  The windup can be INTERRUPTED, but only with specific tools, not with an
  ordinary knockdown. Land one of these on the Guardian while its core is
  charging and the discharge is cancelled:

    <ansi fg="command">throw flashbang</ansi>          a thrown grenade disrupts the core
    <ansi fg="command">cast neural-stun</ansi>         (or sensory-overload, kinetic-shove)

  A plain <ansi fg="command">bash</ansi> or <ansi fg="command">kick</ansi> will NOT interrupt it. Keep an interrupt in
  reserve. A prepared player can survive one blast, but a party that lets
  them through will not last.

